"end":342,"surface":"興祖","kind":"person","person_id":"rsy_qes_ab1","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-049-wanghuan-complete:p009:m0351","start":351,"end":353,"surface":"家人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","unresolved_reason":"劉興祖家人，內含個人數目與姓名未載。"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-049-wanghuan-complete:p009:m0359","start":359,"end":361,"surface":"興祖","kind":"person","person_id":"rsy_qes_ab1","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-049-wanghuan-complete:p009:m0377","start":377,"end":379,"surface":"興祖","kind":"person","person_id":"rsy_qes_ab1","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-049-wanghuan-complete:p009:m0383","start":383,"end":385,"surface":"家人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","unresolved_reason":"另述同見屍傷者。"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-049-wanghuan-complete:p009:m0386","start":386,"end":388,"surface":"門義","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","unresolved_reason":"劉興祖門義，未逐人具名。"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-049-wanghuan-complete:p009:m0404","start":404,"end":407,"surface":"田文喜","kind":"person","person_id":"346_2b8_c91","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-049-wanghuan-complete:p009:m0410","start":410,"end":411,"surface":"倪","kind":"person","person_id":"fab_00e_251","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-049-wanghuan-complete","book_id":"b-nanqishu-049","work_id":"w-nanqishu","source_id":"s-nanqishu-049-wanghuan-complete-ws2261984"},{"id":"c-nanshi-023-wanghuan:p003","text":"永明中，累遷尚書右僕射。王儉卒，上欲用奐為尚書令，以問晏。晏位遇已重，意不推奐，答曰：「柳世隆有勳望，恐不宜在奐後。」乃轉左僕射，加給事中。出為雍州刺史，加都督。與甯蠻長史劉興祖不睦。十一年，奐遣軍主朱公恩征蠻失利，興祖欲以啟聞，奐大怒，收付獄。興祖於獄以針畫漆合盤為書，報家稱枉，令啟聞，而奐亦馳信啟上，誣興祖扇動荒蠻。上知其枉，敕送興祖還都，奐恐辭情翻背，輒殺之。上大怒，遣中書舍人呂文顯、直合將軍曹道剛領兵收奐，又別詔梁州刺史曹武自江陵步出襄陽。奐子彪凶愚，頗幹時政，士人咸切齒。時文顯以漆匣匣箜篌在船中，因相誑云，「台使封刀斬王彪」。及道剛、曹武、文顯俱至，眾力既盛，又懼漆匣之言，於是議閉門拒命。長史殷叡，奐女婿也，諫曰：「今開城門，白服接台使，不過檻車征還，隳官免爵耳。」彪堅執不從，叡又曰：「宜遣典簽間道送啟自申，亦不患不被宥。」乃令叡書啟，遣典簽陳道齊出城，便為文顯所執。叡又曰：「忠不背國，勇不逃死，百世門戶，宜思後計，孰與仰藥自全，則身名俱泰，叡請先驅螻蟻。」又不從。奐門生鄭羽叩頭啟奐，乞出城迎台使，奐曰：「我不作賊，欲先遣啟自申，政恐曹、呂輩小人相陵藉，故且閉門自守耳。」彪遂出戰，敗走歸。土人起義，攻州西門，彪登門拒戰，卻之。司馬黃瑤起、甯蠻長史裴叔業于城內起兵攻奐，奐聞兵入，禮佛，未及起，軍人斬之，彪及弟爽、弼、殷叡皆伏誅。奐長子太子中庶子融，融弟司徒從事中郎琛，於都棄市，余孫皆原宥。琛弟肅、秉並奔魏，後得黃瑤起臠食之。弟伷女為長沙王晃妃，以男女並長，又且出繼，特不離絕。","mentions":[{"id":"c-nanshi-023-wanghuan:p003:m0012","surface":"王儉","start":12,"end":14,"person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-023-wanghuan:p003:m0019","surface":"奐","start":19,"end":20,"person_id":"q7m_r8k_2vn_AA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-023-wanghuan:p003:m0027","surface":"晏","start":27,"end":28,"person_id":"i08_s4b_5bb","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-023-wanghuan:p003:m0029","surface":"晏","start":29,"end":30,"person_id":"i08_s4b_5bb","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-023-wanghuan:p003:m0038","surface":"奐","start":38,"end":39,"person_id":"q7m_r8k_2vn_AA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-023-wanghuan:p003:m0044","surface":"柳世隆","start":44,"end":47,"person_id":"5jc_z9b_i2n_AAAA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-023-wanghuan:p003:m0055","surface":"奐","start":55,"end":56,"person_id":"q7m_r8k_2vn_AA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-023-wanghuan:p003:m0086","surface":"劉興祖","start":86,"end":89,"person_id":"rsy_qes_ab1","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-023-wanghuan:p003:m0096","surface":"奐","start":96,"end":97,"person_id":"q7m_r8k_2vn_AA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-023-wanghuan:p003:m0100","surface":"朱公恩","start":100,"end":103,"person_id":"vbp_km4_ker","ki